# TTS and audio

- Priority order and engine behavior: `docs/tts.md` `## Engines`.
- `TtsController.kt` is large (`docs/agent/map.md` `## Large files`): find members in
  `docs/agent/index/tts.md` and Read by offset.
- Pure helpers (`Crossfade`, `WordHighlight`, `RaceSchedule`) have JVM tests; keep new timing/
  splitting logic pure and tested. Edge synth lives in the Edge TTS plugin (`kind: "tts"`).
- **Edge TTS upstream:** Readest — do not reinvent GEC/handshake. Canonical:
  https://github.com/readest/readest/blob/main/apps/readest-app/src/libs/edgeTTS.ts
  Raw WS (avoid OkHttp upgrade → HTTP 200):
  https://github.com/readest/readest/blob/main/apps/readest-app/src/libs/workersWebSocket.ts
  Plugin: `../flow-reader-plugins/EdgeTts/`; host WS: `PluginWs.kt`.
- Where to edit: `docs/agent/map.md` `## tts`. History, rejected approaches, device quirks:
  `../flow-reader-chats/areas/tts.md`.
